00:24:28.050 --> 00:24:29.550
OFFICIAL PRODUCTION MODEL
UNIT 02

00:24:29.960 --> 00:24:30.970
Shinji!

00:24:31.550 --> 00:24:32.590
<i>Guten Morgen!</i>

00:24:32.680 --> 00:24:34.680
<i>Gooten morgun...</i>

00:24:34.760 --> 00:24:37.760
Geez, you look all mopey,
and it's first thing in the morning.

00:24:37.970 --> 00:24:39.930
I did you the favor of talking to you.

00:24:40.100 --> 00:24:42.640
So maybe you could try to look happy, huh?

00:24:43.440 --> 00:24:47.110
-She's here, right? The other one.
-Other what?

00:24:47.650 --> 00:24:50.900
What kind of idiot are you?
I mean the First Children! Who else?

00:24:51.570 --> 00:24:53.450
Oh, you mean Ayanami. She's...

00:24:56.030 --> 00:24:57.160
<i>Hello!</i>

00:24:57.240 --> 00:25:00.870
So you're Rei Ayanami,
the prototype's pilot.

00:25:02.500 --> 00:25:05.000
I'm Asuka. Asuka Langley Soryu.

00:25:05.580 --> 00:25:08.290
I'm Eva-02's pilot. Let's be friends.

00:25:08.920 --> 00:25:09.750
What for?

00:25:10.300 --> 00:25:13.170
Because it's best for everyone that way.
For various reasons.

00:25:13.840 --> 00:25:15.340
I'll be your friend if I'm ordered to.

00:25:16.220 --> 00:25:17.220
She's a strange one...

00:25:19.050 --> 00:25:21.560
So, is the unison training going well?

00:25:21.680 --> 00:25:23.730
See for yourself.

00:25:27.270 --> 00:25:28.650
What do you expect?!

00:25:28.810 --> 00:25:32.280
It's never going to work if I have to
force myself down to Shinji's level!

00:25:32.360 --> 00:25:34.610
This whole thing is flat-out impossible!

00:25:34.860 --> 00:25:36.160
-Rei?
-Yes, ma'am?

00:25:36.240 --> 00:25:37.110
Give it a try.

00:25:44.620 --> 00:25:46.830
There's no reason for me
to be here anymore.

00:25:47.460 --> 00:25:49.750
Nobody will look at me.

00:25:50.380 --> 00:25:51.840
I'm not a doll.

00:25:53.260 --> 00:25:55.380
Synch graph indicates a drop of 12.8.

00:25:55.970 --> 00:25:57.510
It's barely enough for activation.

00:25:57.590 --> 00:26:00.720
These numbers are terrible.
They're even worse than yesterday's.

00:26:01.600 --> 00:26:04.770
Asuka isn't feeling too hot today.
She's on her period.

00:26:05.140 --> 00:26:08.730
Synch rates aren't affected by
superficial physiological states.

00:26:09.610 --> 00:26:12.020
The problem is deeper down.
In her subconscious.

00:26:12.570 --> 00:26:14.740
<i>Asuka's pride is in shambles.</i>

00:26:16.530 --> 00:26:19.160
<i>It's hardly a surprise,</i>
<i>not after a defeat like that.</i>

00:26:19.410 --> 00:26:24.040
<i>Actually, the fact that she feels like</i>
<i>she lost to Shinji is even worse.</i>

00:27:09.750 --> 00:27:12.250
If you don't open your heart to it,
your Eva won't work.

00:27:12.330 --> 00:27:15.170
You're saying I'm closing myself off?!
I have mental walls?

00:27:15.250 --> 00:27:17.420
Yes. The Evas have a heart.

00:27:17.510 --> 00:27:20.220
-Those dolls have a heart?!
-Deep down, you know that.

00:27:20.800 --> 00:27:24.220
Ha! If you started a conversation
with me, Hell must have frozen over!

00:27:26.310 --> 00:27:30.390
What, does me not being able to pilot
my Eva make you that happy?

00:27:30.560 --> 00:27:35.520
Don't worry! If an Angel comes,
Shinji the Mighty will defeat it!

00:27:35.730 --> 00:27:37.860
We don't need to lift a finger!

00:27:39.820 --> 00:27:43.490
First it was Shinji, and now even
a clockwork doll like you is pitying me!

00:27:43.570 --> 00:27:45.450
I really must have lost my edge!

00:27:46.160 --> 00:27:47.660
I'm not a doll.

00:27:47.740 --> 00:27:50.750
Like hell you're not!
All you do is follow orders!

00:27:50.830 --> 00:27:53.130
If Commander Ikari told you to die,
you'd do it, <i>wouldn't</i> you?!

00:27:53.710 --> 00:27:54.540
I would.

00:27:57.340 --> 00:27:58.380
Good morning.

00:27:59.630 --> 00:28:01.380
NO. 3 JUNIOR HIGH SCHOOL AUDITORIUM

00:28:02.970 --> 00:28:04.510
VIOLA, THE THIRD PLAYER

00:28:04.600 --> 00:28:06.310
FIVE MINUTES, 43 SECONDS BEFORE
STRING QUARTET RECITAL PRACTICE

00:28:08.390 --> 00:28:09.520
TUNING

00:28:16.150 --> 00:28:19.740
Yo, big guy! Who are you staring at?

00:28:19.820 --> 00:28:21.900
-Uh, nobody.
-Could it be...

00:28:22.280 --> 00:28:24.490
-...Ayanami, maybe?!
-No!

00:28:24.570 --> 00:28:28.160
Hah, as if!
Talk about suspicious behavior! Right?

00:28:28.240 --> 00:28:31.790
Ayanami's breasts... Ayanami's thighs...

00:28:31.870 --> 00:28:34.710
-Ayanami's calves!
-...calves!

00:28:35.500 --> 00:28:37.170
I wasn't, okay?

00:28:37.250 --> 00:28:38.880
What were you looking at, then?

00:28:38.960 --> 00:28:40.760
You can't pull the wool over my eyes!

00:28:43.930 --> 00:28:47.680
I was just wondering
why she's always alone.

00:28:48.680 --> 00:28:49.970
Oh. Now that you mention it,

00:28:50.060 --> 00:28:53.810
I don't think she's made any friends
since she transferred here last year.

00:28:53.890 --> 00:28:58.770
You're both Eva pilots.
Shouldn't you know her better than us?

00:28:58.860 --> 00:28:59.690
He's right.

00:29:01.150 --> 00:29:03.700
I guess we don't talk all that much.

00:29:04.570 --> 00:29:07.740
She's a really sweet girl,
but just like your father,

00:29:07.820 --> 00:29:09.450
she's all thumbs.

00:29:10.040 --> 00:29:12.120
All thumbs? At what?

00:29:13.330 --> 00:29:14.670
At living.

00:29:22.670 --> 00:29:24.510
AYANAMI

00:29:32.640 --> 00:29:34.140
Hello?

00:29:35.020 --> 00:29:37.560
Is anyone home? It's Ikari.

00:29:39.190 --> 00:29:40.480
Ayanami? I'm coming in.

00:29:58.580 --> 00:29:59.840
Are these hers?

00:30:13.140 --> 00:30:14.140
I...

00:30:16.350 --> 00:30:17.520
I didn't mean to--

00:30:47.010 --> 00:30:48.010
Could you move?

00:30:50.970 --> 00:30:52.350
I...

00:31:07.190 --> 00:31:08.200
What?

00:31:08.740 --> 00:31:12.700
Er, I... That is...

00:31:16.620 --> 00:31:19.160
They asked me to...

00:31:19.750 --> 00:31:22.500
To do what? Your card!

00:31:22.580 --> 00:31:24.420
Your card's been renewed,

00:31:25.090 --> 00:31:26.630
so I was supposed to drop it off.

00:31:28.170 --> 00:31:30.050
That's... That's why I...

00:31:30.130 --> 00:31:31.720
I wasn't trying to...

00:31:35.350 --> 00:31:36.180
<i>Say...</i>

00:31:37.390 --> 00:31:41.770
Aren't you scared of getting
into your Unit 00 again?

00:31:42.350 --> 00:31:43.400
Why would I be?

00:31:46.320 --> 00:31:49.780
I heard you were hurt really badly
during that test earlier,

00:31:49.860 --> 00:31:51.780
so I was curious if you were worried.

00:31:53.120 --> 00:31:55.450
You're Commander Ikari's son, right?

00:31:57.040 --> 00:31:59.870
You don't have faith
in your father's work?

00:32:00.410 --> 00:32:02.960
Of course not!
Have faith in a father like him?!

00:32:13.590 --> 00:32:14.720
Ayanami...

00:32:15.550 --> 00:32:18.220
The following is the schedule
for Operation Yashima,

00:32:18.310 --> 00:32:20.770
which will begin at 0000 hours tonight:

00:32:22.520 --> 00:32:27.900
"Pilots Ikari and Ayanami will report
to the Cage at 1730 hours today.

00:32:28.320 --> 00:32:32.360
1800 hours.
Units 00 and 01 will be activated.

00:32:32.820 --> 00:32:34.820
1805 hours. Depart HQ.

00:32:35.280 --> 00:32:38.160
1830 hours.
Arrive at temporary base at Mt. Futago.

00:32:38.490 --> 00:32:40.410
Once there, await further instructions.

00:32:40.750 --> 00:32:44.330
When the clock strikes midnight,
operation will commence."

00:32:45.380 --> 00:32:46.500
Dinner.

00:32:49.670 --> 00:32:51.840
I'm not hungry.

00:32:52.800 --> 00:32:54.890
We leave in 60 minutes.

00:32:56.090 --> 00:32:59.390
Do I have to pilot that thing again?

00:33:00.350 --> 00:33:02.180
Yes, that's right.

00:33:04.060 --> 00:33:09.190
I'm done. I don't want
to go through that ever again.

00:33:10.110 --> 00:33:11.740
Then stay in bed.

00:33:13.740 --> 00:33:14.950
What do you mean?

00:33:15.280 --> 00:33:17.780
I'll pilot Unit 01.

00:33:19.830 --> 00:33:24.500
Dr. Akagi has made preparations
to rewrite Unit 01's personal data.

00:33:25.170 --> 00:33:26.250
Ms. Ritsuko did that?

00:33:26.330 --> 00:33:27.710
You're not safe! Stand back!

00:33:28.420 --> 00:33:29.790
ACTIVATION

00:33:29.880 --> 00:33:30.920
NEURAL PULSE FLOW REVERSAL

00:33:31.590 --> 00:33:32.420
ANGUISH

00:33:36.260 --> 00:33:37.470
DESTROY

00:33:39.100 --> 00:33:40.430
ACTIVATION

00:33:40.510 --> 00:33:41.350
DESTROY

00:33:41.430 --> 00:33:42.270
ANGUISH

00:33:42.350 --> 00:33:43.770
DESTROY

00:33:46.350 --> 00:33:47.230
MULTIPURPOSE HUMANOID DECISIVE WEAPON
ARTIFICIAL HUMAN EVANGELION

00:33:47.310 --> 00:33:48.770
PROTOTYPE
UNIT 00

00:33:49.940 --> 00:33:50.940
Farewell.

00:33:53.820 --> 00:33:57.910
<i>-Why do you pilot it, Ayanami?</i>
<i>-It's my link.</i>

00:33:57.990 --> 00:34:00.950
<i>-Your link?</i>
<i>-Yes, my link.</i>

00:34:01.540 --> 00:34:03.750
<i>-To my father?</i>
<i>-To everyone.</i>

00:34:04.330 --> 00:34:06.670
<i>You sure are tough, Ayanami.</i>

00:34:07.210 --> 00:34:09.960
<i>I don't have anything else.</i>

00:34:11.090 --> 00:34:12.090
<i>Farewell.</i>

00:34:17.090 --> 00:34:18.970
Ayanami! Are you okay?!

00:34:19.680 --> 00:34:20.680
Ayanami!

00:34:31.730 --> 00:34:37.400
Don't... Don't say that you
don't have anything else, okay?

00:34:39.740 --> 00:34:43.700
Don't say sad stuff like "farewell"
whenever you walk off, okay?

00:34:58.510 --> 00:34:59.800
Why are you crying?

00:35:02.140 --> 00:35:03.220
I'm sorry.

00:35:03.640 --> 00:35:06.730
I don't know how I should act
at times like this.

00:35:09.310 --> 00:35:10.810
Smiling would be a good start.

00:35:22.780 --> 00:35:23.660
Ayanami?

00:35:24.410 --> 00:35:26.040
<i>It's fine. I'll go.</i>

00:35:26.750 --> 00:35:28.790
<i>Even if I die, there are replacements.</i>

00:35:28.870 --> 00:35:30.250
-She's going to blow herself up?!
-Rei!

00:35:34.840 --> 00:35:36.000
<i>A.T. Field to maximum.</i>

00:35:37.300 --> 00:35:40.680
<i>-Dreaming?</i>
<i>-Yeah. You've never dreamed before?</i>

00:35:48.730 --> 00:35:51.560
We have to complete everything
before Seele can act.

00:35:53.270 --> 00:35:56.440
It would be unwise
to lose Unit 02. Not yet.

00:35:56.520 --> 00:36:00.820
Using the Spear of Longinus
without Seele's permission'll be trouble.

00:36:02.490 --> 00:36:05.910
You can stay in bed today.
We’ll take care of the rest.

00:36:06.370 --> 00:36:09.040
Thanks, but I'm okay now.

00:36:09.870 --> 00:36:11.920
Oh, I'm glad to hear it.

00:36:23.680 --> 00:36:24.890
Rei! Return fire!

00:36:25.970 --> 00:36:27.720
Rei Ayanami, 14.

00:36:28.220 --> 00:36:30.980
The first qualified subject approved by
Marduk Institute research reports.

00:36:31.770 --> 00:36:32.770
The First Children.

00:36:33.020 --> 00:36:35.860
Designated pilot of Evangelion
prototype Unit 00.

00:36:36.400 --> 00:36:39.230
Her past is a blank slate.
All records erased.

00:36:39.440 --> 00:36:41.110
Corruption by target is progressing!

00:36:45.490 --> 00:36:46.780
Launch! Got that?

00:36:47.870 --> 00:36:49.580
Eva-02, lift off!

00:36:50.700 --> 00:36:53.120
Get out there! What's wrong, Asuka?

00:36:53.210 --> 00:36:54.750
-Unit 02's status?
-No-go!

00:36:54.830 --> 00:36:57.380
-Her synch rate is in the single digits!
-Asuka!

00:36:57.960 --> 00:37:01.460
-It won't move... It won't move!
-I'll go in Unit 02.

00:37:01.550 --> 00:37:05.220
Aching? No, that's not it. It's lonely.

00:37:06.260 --> 00:37:07.640
Yes, that's it. It's lonely.

00:37:12.680 --> 00:37:14.350
The one that's crying... is me?

00:37:16.600 --> 00:37:20.690
-Rei!
-The lockdown on Unit 01 is hereby lifted.

00:37:20.780 --> 00:37:22.940
-Launch it immediately.
-Sir?

00:37:23.030 --> 00:37:25.660
-Launch it.
-Yes, sir!

00:37:28.320 --> 00:37:31.370
What the hell? They didn't send him out
when I was the one who needed help!

00:37:37.540 --> 00:37:40.710
<i>-Deploy A.T. Field! Rescue Rei! Hurry!</i>
-Yes, ma'am!

00:37:41.460 --> 00:37:43.420
-<i>It smells like Shinji.</i>
-Shinji!

00:37:47.720 --> 00:37:51.310
This is what my heart wants?
I want to be one with Shinji?

00:37:53.390 --> 00:37:54.680
No!

00:37:54.770 --> 00:37:56.270
Her A.T. Field is inverting!

00:37:57.520 --> 00:38:02.190
I can't. Without me,
the A.T. Field will vanish.

00:38:02.280 --> 00:38:03.610
So I can't go.

00:38:06.610 --> 00:38:07.740
Rei, are you going to...

00:38:13.950 --> 00:38:15.040
TWELVE YEARS EARLIER

00:38:15.960 --> 00:38:17.960
Another day that's the same as the last.

00:38:18.420 --> 00:38:21.670
I can't tell you how much
I miss autumn in this country.

00:38:22.460 --> 00:38:27.090
According to the scenario set out
in Seele's Hidden Dead Sea Scrolls,

00:38:27.180 --> 00:38:30.180
the Third Impact will occur
some ten years from now.

00:38:30.260 --> 00:38:33.100
Two groups exist for the sole purpose
of preventing that final tragedy:

00:38:33.640 --> 00:38:35.480
Seele and Gehirn.

00:38:35.560 --> 00:38:39.480
It's your views that I'm
in agreement with, not Seele's.

00:38:40.020 --> 00:38:44.940
Professor Fuyutsuki, breaking that seal
to the world is extremely dangerous.

00:38:45.690 --> 00:38:47.900
I've given all of my research to Ikari.

00:38:48.490 --> 00:38:51.120
This is beyond
what one single person can do.

00:38:51.370 --> 00:38:53.990
I have no intention of repeating
my previous behavior.

00:38:55.160 --> 00:38:57.460
I've also received subtle warnings.

00:38:58.210 --> 00:39:01.250
It looks like they could eliminate me
with no trouble at all.

00:39:01.330 --> 00:39:03.630
The rest of us survivors, as well.

00:39:03.710 --> 00:39:06.090
It's a simple thing to destroy people.

00:39:06.170 --> 00:39:09.220
Even so, there's no reason for you
to be the test subject.

00:39:10.340 --> 00:39:12.550
I will ride along the currents.

00:39:13.470 --> 00:39:16.520
That's why I'm with Seele.

00:39:16.770 --> 00:39:17.890
This is also for Shinji.

00:39:22.150 --> 00:39:25.360
It's been three years since
we last came here together.

00:39:26.110 --> 00:39:30.410
I ran away from home after that.
I haven't been back since.

00:39:31.320 --> 00:39:34.950
It hardly seems like
Mother is resting here.

00:39:35.160 --> 00:39:36.540
I can't even remember her face.

00:39:36.620 --> 00:39:39.500
Forgetting is what
lets people go on living.

00:39:40.000 --> 00:39:42.670
But there are some things
that we must never forget.

00:39:43.330 --> 00:39:46.250
That's an important lesson
that Yui taught me.

00:39:46.550 --> 00:39:49.550
I come here to remind myself
of that lesson.

00:39:51.630 --> 00:39:53.050
Don't you have any pictures?

00:39:53.260 --> 00:39:57.640
None. This grave itself is a facade.
There's no body.

00:39:57.770 --> 00:40:00.810
They said you threw everything away.
You really did.

00:40:01.600 --> 00:40:04.770
You keep what's important inside you.
That's enough for now.

00:40:06.270 --> 00:40:07.280
FIVE YEARS AGO

00:40:07.360 --> 00:40:09.530
The night before she died,
Mother said something to me.

00:40:09.690 --> 00:40:11.780
That the Magi were
three facets of herself.

00:40:12.320 --> 00:40:15.030
The scientist in her. The mother in her.

00:40:15.120 --> 00:40:16.330
The woman in her.

00:40:17.370 --> 00:40:20.290
The Magi are those three sides of her,
constantly vying for control.

00:40:21.120 --> 00:40:23.500
She deliberately incorporated
the inner conflict we all have.

00:40:24.080 --> 00:40:26.960
Ever the aloof ice queen, I see.

00:40:27.300 --> 00:40:29.960
Careful, happiness is going
to pass you by.

00:40:30.760 --> 00:40:32.970
I have even more trouble
with how to define happiness.

00:40:33.890 --> 00:40:36.510
I should go. It's been forever
since I went out for a drink.

00:40:36.890 --> 00:40:39.140
-Good work today.
-You, too.

00:40:50.530 --> 00:40:51.990
Can I help you, Rei?

00:40:52.530 --> 00:40:53.530
I got lost.

00:40:54.030 --> 00:40:57.370
Oh, really? Well, do you want me
to show you the way out?

00:40:57.450 --> 00:40:58.530
No.

00:40:58.620 --> 00:41:01.370
But you can't find your way out
by yourself, right?

00:41:01.450 --> 00:41:03.290
I don't need your help, you hag.

00:41:04.870 --> 00:41:05.880
What?

00:41:05.960 --> 00:41:08.380
I can find my own way out,
so leave me alone, you hag.

00:41:09.250 --> 00:41:12.170
Calling someone a hag is very rude.

00:41:12.380 --> 00:41:13.840
But you are one, aren't you?

00:41:14.470 --> 00:41:17.600
You're making me angry.
You need a scolding from Director Ikari.

00:41:17.680 --> 00:41:20.930
-He's the one who says that about you.
-What?

00:41:21.020 --> 00:41:24.190
Things like, "That old hag is such a nag."
Or, "I don't need that hag anymore."

00:41:26.270 --> 00:41:28.900
"That old hag is such a nag."
Or, "I don't need that hag anymore."

00:41:28.980 --> 00:41:30.320
"I don't need that hag anymore."

00:41:30.400 --> 00:41:34.650
"I don't need that hag anymore."
He's the one who says that.

00:41:40.370 --> 00:41:41.660
Even if you die...

00:42:12.610 --> 00:42:13.740
The Eva has reactivated.

00:42:23.450 --> 00:42:24.580
Incredible...

00:42:25.200 --> 00:42:27.370
Impossible! I don't believe it!

00:42:27.540 --> 00:42:30.420
Unit 01's synch rate is over 400%!

00:42:30.960 --> 00:42:33.500
Does this mean... she's awake?

00:43:16.130 --> 00:43:18.050
It's <i>eating</i> the Angel...

00:43:22.970 --> 00:43:27.770
Is it trying to incorporate
its S2 Drive into itself?

00:43:49.080 --> 00:43:49.910
The restraints!

00:43:50.410 --> 00:43:51.250
Restraints?

00:43:51.790 --> 00:43:53.920
Yes. Those aren't armor plating.

00:43:54.630 --> 00:43:58.380
They're restraints we put on the Evas
to contain their intrinsic power.

00:43:58.460 --> 00:44:01.840
It's using brute force
to break free of our control.

00:44:01.930 --> 00:44:04.890
We humans can no longer keep
that Eva under our control.

00:44:06.010 --> 00:44:08.270
The awakening and liberation of Unit 01...

00:44:08.560 --> 00:44:10.140
Seele won't take this lying down.

00:44:11.020 --> 00:44:13.600
Is this also part of your scenario,
Commander Ikari?

00:44:14.900 --> 00:44:16.690
-It's begun, hasn't it?
-Yes.

00:44:17.320 --> 00:44:18.900
It all starts now.

00:44:30.370 --> 00:44:31.410
I'm still alive.

00:44:32.620 --> 00:44:34.830
<i>Paging Dr. Ugai.</i>
<i>Dr. Ugai of Internal Medicine Dept. 1...</i>

00:44:34.920 --> 00:44:36.040
Ayanami!

00:44:37.000 --> 00:44:39.630
Thank goodness you're alive, Ayanami.

00:44:41.510 --> 00:44:42.930
Father isn't here, huh?

00:44:44.970 --> 00:44:47.100
Thanks for saving me.

00:44:47.180 --> 00:44:48.180
From what?

00:44:48.510 --> 00:44:52.940
What do you mean?
You sacrificed Unit 00 to save me.

00:44:53.140 --> 00:44:55.100
Oh. I saved you.

00:44:55.440 --> 00:44:57.480
Yeah. Don't you remember?

00:44:57.570 --> 00:44:59.070
No. I don't know about it.

00:45:00.030 --> 00:45:02.610
Because I think I'm probably
the third one.

00:45:06.990 --> 00:45:08.450
Rei... Ayanami!

00:45:09.660 --> 00:45:11.750
Hang on, the Evas' Dummy Plugs are--

00:45:12.250 --> 00:45:14.670
Yes. These form the core
of the Dummy System.

00:45:15.250 --> 00:45:17.710
-This is their production plant.
-They're...

00:45:18.460 --> 00:45:22.420
These are just empty dummies.
And simple spare parts for Rei.

00:45:23.260 --> 00:45:26.510
Mankind stumbled across God.
Overjoyed, we tried to possess it.

00:45:26.590 --> 00:45:29.600
And so, we were punished.
That happened 15 years ago.

00:45:30.010 --> 00:45:32.520
The God we were so excited about vanished.

00:45:33.180 --> 00:45:36.270
<i>Undeterred, we then tried</i>
<i>to resurrect God.</i>

00:45:37.360 --> 00:45:38.190
<i>That was Adam.</i>

00:45:38.770 --> 00:45:41.900
<i>We made humans from Adam in God's image.</i>

00:45:41.980 --> 00:45:42.860
<i>Those are the Evas.</i>

00:45:43.820 --> 00:45:46.160
<i>They're people? They're human beings?</i>

00:45:46.660 --> 00:45:48.410
<i>Yes. They're human.</i>

00:45:48.950 --> 00:45:52.750
<i>The Evas are intrinsically soulless,</i>
<i>so we imbue them with one.</i>

00:45:52.830 --> 00:45:55.210
<i>They're cobbled together</i>
<i>with salvaged material.</i>

00:45:55.290 --> 00:45:58.420
<i>The only vessel that contained</i>
<i>a soul was Rei. Only her.</i>

00:45:58.500 --> 00:46:00.290
<i>Only she was born with a soul.</i>

00:46:01.210 --> 00:46:03.050
<i>The Chamber of Guf was completely empty.</i>

00:46:04.220 --> 00:46:06.930
None of these Rei-shaped things
has a soul.

00:46:07.010 --> 00:46:08.390
They're just empty shells.

00:46:08.970 --> 00:46:11.310
So I'm going to smash them.
Because I hate them.

00:46:19.900 --> 00:46:21.730
Do you have any idea what you've done?!

00:46:23.280 --> 00:46:26.030
Yes, I know. I've destroyed property.

00:46:26.450 --> 00:46:27.820
These things aren't human.

00:46:27.910 --> 00:46:30.410
<i>They're human-shaped objects.</i>

00:46:35.410 --> 00:46:39.000
-Where have you been?!
-Sorry about that.

00:46:39.210 --> 00:46:40.710
STRING QUARTET RECITAL PRACTICE
START TIME

00:46:40.880 --> 00:46:42.000
PRECISELY

00:46:42.170 --> 00:46:44.920
FIRST VIOLIN,
THE FIRST PLAYER

00:46:57.480 --> 00:46:58.940
-Ready?
-Yeah.

00:46:59.150 --> 00:47:01.730
STRING QUARTET

00:47:44.980 --> 00:47:48.860
Sorry, newbie. But I have to punch you.

00:47:49.530 --> 00:47:51.990
I couldn't live with myself otherwise.

00:47:52.780 --> 00:47:55.870
It's not like I pilot that thing
because I want to.

00:47:57.450 --> 00:47:58.750
Guess it's time to go.

00:48:03.710 --> 00:48:04.710
INSERTION

00:48:06.380 --> 00:48:07.380
OFFICIAL PRODUCTION MODEL
UNIT 03

00:48:07.920 --> 00:48:08.920
NO CONTROL

00:48:11.430 --> 00:48:12.430
PARASITE

00:48:13.930 --> 00:48:14.890
HORRIFIC

00:48:14.970 --> 00:48:15.930
THREAT

00:48:16.010 --> 00:48:17.010
VIOLATE

00:48:17.770 --> 00:48:19.100
PARASITE

00:48:19.180 --> 00:48:20.390
VIOLATE

00:48:21.520 --> 00:48:22.520
HORRIFIC

00:48:24.480 --> 00:48:25.520
MULTIPURPOSE HUMANOID DECISIVE WEAPON
ARTIFICIAL HUMAN EVANGELION

00:48:25.610 --> 00:48:28.190
<i>Evangelion Unit 03 is hereby</i>
<i>declared a total loss.</i>

00:48:28.440 --> 00:48:31.070
<i>Target is now designated</i>
<i>as the 13th Angel.</i>

00:48:32.570 --> 00:48:33.990
He's inside there...

00:48:35.700 --> 00:48:36.530
That's an Angel?

00:48:37.280 --> 00:48:38.620
Is it really an Angel?!

00:48:38.700 --> 00:48:40.830
<i>That's right. It's your target.</i>

00:48:58.390 --> 00:49:00.470
<i>Shinji, why aren't you fighting back?</i>

00:49:00.560 --> 00:49:03.940
There's... There's somebody
in there, Father!

00:49:04.020 --> 00:49:07.230
Irrelevant!
That thing is an Angel! Our enemy!

00:49:07.310 --> 00:49:09.730
But I... I can't!

00:49:09.820 --> 00:49:12.950
We have to save him!
I can't murder somebody!

00:49:13.030 --> 00:49:14.280
You'll die if you don't.

00:49:14.360 --> 00:49:17.030
That's fine! I'd rather die
than kill someone!

00:49:18.080 --> 00:49:18.990
So be it.

00:49:19.080 --> 00:49:21.620
Sever the synchronization
between the pilot and Unit 01.

00:49:21.700 --> 00:49:23.040
Sever it, sir?

00:49:23.210 --> 00:49:26.330
Yes. Switch control over
to the Dummy Plug.

00:49:26.420 --> 00:49:29.670
But, sir, the Dummy System
is still plagued with issues,

00:49:29.750 --> 00:49:31.300
and without Dr. Akagi's supervision, it--

00:49:31.380 --> 00:49:34.590
It will still be more useful
than this pilot. Do it!

00:49:46.690 --> 00:49:48.310
What did you do, Father?!

00:50:03.410 --> 00:50:06.460
-<i>All systems nominal.</i>
-<i>Gain continuing to climb!</i>

00:50:32.820 --> 00:50:37.320
<i>Tohji was sorry he hit you.</i>
<i>I hear his little sister chewed him out.</i>

00:50:37.950 --> 00:50:42.120
<i>She said it was your robot</i>
<i>that saved us all.</i>

00:50:46.120 --> 00:50:47.250
<i>Stop it!</i>

00:50:48.420 --> 00:50:51.380
<i>Father, stop! You've got to stop this!</i>

00:50:51.460 --> 00:50:53.670
Damn it, <i>stop!</i>

00:50:53.750 --> 00:50:56.880
Stop!

00:50:56.970 --> 00:50:59.260
Stop!

00:50:59.340 --> 00:51:02.430
Stop!

00:51:04.970 --> 00:51:06.430
Don't do it!

00:51:07.730 --> 00:51:09.020
I think I'll make this one.

00:51:09.900 --> 00:51:11.730
I sure hope he'll eat it tomorrow!

00:51:16.780 --> 00:51:20.360
<i>Shinji, I'm sorry I didn't tell you.</i>

00:51:20.950 --> 00:51:24.450
<i>The pilot of Unit 03...</i>
<i>The Fourth Children, it's...</i>

00:51:26.120 --> 00:51:26.950
Tohji?

00:51:28.120 --> 00:51:29.160
<i>Shinji?</i>

00:51:29.870 --> 00:51:31.040
<i>Shinji?</i>

00:51:35.050 --> 00:51:36.880
<i>What kind of man is my father?</i>

00:51:37.880 --> 00:51:39.630
<i>That sure wasn't what I was expecting.</i>

00:51:39.720 --> 00:51:41.550
<i>I thought you were going to ask</i>
<i>about Katsuragi.</i>

00:51:41.640 --> 00:51:44.760
<i>It just seems like you're always with him.</i>

00:51:44.850 --> 00:51:46.680
<i>It's the Deputy Commander</i>
<i>who's always with him.</i>

00:51:46.770 --> 00:51:49.730
<i>Is this your thing,</i>
<i>asking everyone about your father?</i>

00:51:50.890 --> 00:51:53.690
<i>I wasn't with him for a long time.</i>

00:51:54.150 --> 00:51:55.440
<i>Oh, you really don't know him.</i>

00:51:55.520 --> 00:51:59.610
<i>But I've learned a fair amount lately.</i>
<i>About my father.</i>

00:51:59.740 --> 00:52:02.780
<i>About his job. About my mother.</i>

00:52:03.820 --> 00:52:04.660
<i>So I--</i>

00:52:04.740 --> 00:52:07.870
<i>No, that's where you're wrong.</i>
<i>You only think you learned something.</i>

00:52:09.500 --> 00:52:11.670
<i>Nobody can ever completely</i>
<i>understand another person.</i>

00:52:12.290 --> 00:52:13.960
<i>Good luck even understanding </i>yourself.

00:52:14.460 --> 00:52:16.800
<i>Complete understanding</i>
<i>between two people is impossible.</i>

00:52:17.050 --> 00:52:21.180
<i>That's why people try so hard</i>
<i>to understand themselves and others.</i>

00:52:21.260 --> 00:52:23.470
<i>It's one of the things</i>
<i>that makes life interesting.</i>

00:52:23.930 --> 00:52:25.510
<i>Does that go for you and Misato, too?</i>

00:52:27.640 --> 00:52:30.310
<i>The characters for the word "girlfriend"</i>
<i>literally mean "distant woman."</i>

00:52:31.020 --> 00:52:34.310
<i>Women are creatures on an alien shore.</i>
<i>As far as we men are concerned.</i>

00:52:35.230 --> 00:52:37.480
<i>So, what were you doing in Kyoto?</i>

00:52:37.570 --> 00:52:40.030
Huh? I picked that up in Matsushiro!

00:52:40.110 --> 00:52:43.860
Don't play dumb.
If you dig too deep, you'll get burned.

00:52:44.160 --> 00:52:46.370
Advice from a concerned friend.

00:52:46.490 --> 00:52:47.910
I'll take it to heart.

00:52:48.290 --> 00:52:50.950
If I'll get burned anyway,
I want it be from us--

00:52:51.080 --> 00:52:54.000
-Can I buy some matches for you?
-Hey, you're back.

00:52:54.080 --> 00:52:55.380
You'll never change.

00:52:55.460 --> 00:52:57.920
<i>Kaji? Do you think I've changed?</i>

00:52:58.800 --> 00:53:01.380
<i>-You're more beautiful.</i>
<i>-I'm so tired.</i>

00:53:01.470 --> 00:53:02.930
<i>Tired of keeping myself</i>
<i>clean and pretty.</i>

00:53:03.630 --> 00:53:07.640
<i>Tired of the me that keeps up the charade</i>
<i>of being clean and pretty. I'm exhausted.</i>

00:53:08.180 --> 00:53:11.560
<i>I wanted to see myself absolutely filthy.</i>

00:53:12.270 --> 00:53:13.560
<i>Sounds like men and women.</i>

00:53:15.900 --> 00:53:17.020
<i>Hi, Katsuragi.</i>

00:53:17.900 --> 00:53:18.900
<i>It's me.</i>

00:53:19.190 --> 00:53:24.200
<i>By the time you get this message,</i>
<i>I've probably made life difficult for you.</i>

00:53:25.410 --> 00:53:29.080
<i>Sorry about that.</i>
<i>And apologize to Ritchan for me, okay?</i>

00:53:30.120 --> 00:53:33.290
<i>I shouldn't be asking favors,</i>
<i>but I've been growing some flowers.</i>

00:53:34.250 --> 00:53:36.580
<i>If you could water them for me,</i>
<i>I'd appreciate it.</i>

00:53:37.170 --> 00:53:38.670
<i>Shinji knows where they are.</i>

00:53:40.210 --> 00:53:44.510
<i>Katsuragi... The truth is with you.</i>

00:53:46.010 --> 00:53:47.470
<i>Keep going and don't look back.</i>

00:53:48.180 --> 00:53:51.100
<i>If I see you again...</i>

00:53:52.020 --> 00:53:54.480
<i>I'll say the words that I couldn't</i>
<i>say to you eight years ago.</i>

00:53:54.810 --> 00:53:55.640
<i>Bye.</i>

00:53:56.400 --> 00:53:57.400
<i>You idiot...</i>

00:53:57.900 --> 00:53:59.820
<i>You're such an idiot...</i>

00:54:04.610 --> 00:54:07.160
Hi. What took you so long?

00:54:08.740 --> 00:54:11.700
<i>Stop making up crap like that!</i>
<i>Like you'd know, Idiot Shinji!</i>

00:54:11.790 --> 00:54:15.870
<i>How many times do I have to tell you?!</i>
<i>Mr. Kaji is </i>gone,<i> damn it!</i>

00:54:16.540 --> 00:54:17.540
You're lying...

00:55:01.750 --> 00:55:03.050
Aren't songs great?

00:55:05.760 --> 00:55:07.670
Songs enrich the heart.

00:55:08.680 --> 00:55:11.220
They're the crowning achievement
of Lilin culture.

00:55:11.850 --> 00:55:13.220
Don't you think so...

00:55:14.600 --> 00:55:15.680
Shinji Ikari?

00:55:15.770 --> 00:55:18.690
-You know my name?
-Everybody knows you.

00:55:19.100 --> 00:55:23.190
No offense, but I think you should
be more aware of your importance.

00:55:23.270 --> 00:55:24.570
I should?

00:55:25.230 --> 00:55:26.530
Um, who are you?

00:55:26.740 --> 00:55:28.950
I'm Kaworu. Kaworu Nagisa.

00:55:29.490 --> 00:55:32.910
Like you, I'm a child whose path has
been set out. I'm the Fifth Children.

00:55:33.160 --> 00:55:37.200
You're the Fifth Children, uh... Nagisa?

00:55:37.830 --> 00:55:39.620
Call me Kaworu, Ikari.

00:55:40.170 --> 00:55:42.880
Um, call me Shinji, then.

00:55:46.260 --> 00:55:48.720
Let's go. Come along, alter ego of Adam

00:55:49.220 --> 00:55:50.760
and servant of the Lilin.

00:55:57.350 --> 00:55:58.810
Eva Unit 02 has activated!

00:55:58.890 --> 00:56:00.770
That's impossible! Where's Asuka?

00:56:00.850 --> 00:56:03.520
In hospital room 303! I have confirmation!

00:56:03.610 --> 00:56:04.940
Then who--

00:56:05.020 --> 00:56:08.690
It's unmanned! Unit 02 doesn't have
an entry plug inserted!

00:56:08.780 --> 00:56:11.990
<i>It's unmanned?</i>
<i>Then the Fifth isn't doing this?</i>

00:56:13.070 --> 00:56:15.700
A.T. Field generation detected
in the Central Dogma!

00:56:15.780 --> 00:56:17.790
-Is it Unit 02?
-Negative! Pattern Blue!

00:56:17.870 --> 00:56:20.370
-No doubt about it, it's an Angel!
-It's what?

00:56:22.250 --> 00:56:24.130
That boy... He's an <i>Angel?</i>

00:56:26.250 --> 00:56:28.800
<i>Target passing Level 4! Still descending!</i>

00:56:29.090 --> 00:56:31.130
It's no use!
Unable to cut power to the Maglev!

00:56:31.220 --> 00:56:32.680
<i>Target passing Level 5!</i>

00:56:33.300 --> 00:56:35.970
All Central Dogma blast doors,
emergency lockdown!

00:56:36.350 --> 00:56:38.180
Buy us some time. I don't care how much.

00:56:38.850 --> 00:56:42.060
<i>Emergency lockdown of all</i>
<i>Malebolge levels! All personnel, evacuate!</i>

00:56:42.140 --> 00:56:44.060
<i>All personnel, evacuate!</i>

00:56:44.650 --> 00:56:47.400
I can't believe Seele
would send one directly at us...

00:56:47.480 --> 00:56:51.780
The old men are trying to skip a step.
Using us to do it.

00:56:51.860 --> 00:56:56.620
Man has forgotten his foolishness
and now repeats the mistakes of the past.

00:56:56.700 --> 00:57:00.700
Man will never change
without first making atonement.

00:57:00.790 --> 00:57:03.080
We will not use Adam or the Angels.

00:57:03.170 --> 00:57:06.340
We must bring forth the future
by our own hands.

00:57:06.840 --> 00:57:09.170
Let us hope Unit 01
will carry out the task.

00:57:11.420 --> 00:57:14.300
Eva-02 is breaching the armored bulkheads!

00:57:14.380 --> 00:57:16.510
Target has passed Cocytus No.2!

00:57:16.600 --> 00:57:19.310
-Have Eva-01 pursue.
-Yes, sir!

00:57:19.390 --> 00:57:22.140
Use any means necessary
to prevent the target

00:57:22.230 --> 00:57:24.060
from entering the Terminal Dogma.

00:57:27.310 --> 00:57:29.440
<i>But why did the Angel take Unit 02?</i>

00:57:30.150 --> 00:57:32.950
Does it intend to merge
with Unit 02, perhaps?

00:57:33.030 --> 00:57:35.280
Or to bring about our destruction.

00:57:35.360 --> 00:57:36.870
It's a lie! A lie! A lie!

00:57:36.950 --> 00:57:39.790
Kaworu's a... He's an Angel?!

00:57:39.870 --> 00:57:41.120
That's not true!

00:57:41.620 --> 00:57:43.410
<i>Facts are facts. Just accept it.</i>

00:57:43.500 --> 00:57:45.540
<i>You need to launch. Ready?</i>

00:57:49.420 --> 00:57:51.210
What's keeping you, Shinji?

00:57:51.300 --> 00:57:53.170
<i>Eva-01 descending Route 2!</i>

00:57:53.260 --> 00:57:54.760
<i>In pursuit of target!</i>

00:57:55.300 --> 00:57:58.470
You betrayed me! You betrayed my feelings!

00:57:58.550 --> 00:58:00.760
You betrayed me, just like Father!

00:58:01.350 --> 00:58:04.390
Unit 01 has arrived at Level 4.
About to make contact with target.

00:58:04.480 --> 00:58:05.690
There he is!

00:58:07.100 --> 00:58:08.650
I've been waiting for you, Shinji.

00:58:08.730 --> 00:58:09.650
Kaworu!

00:58:14.780 --> 00:58:16.280
Asuka, I'm sorry!

00:58:19.450 --> 00:58:20.830
The Eva Series...

00:58:20.910 --> 00:58:23.950
Creatures born of Adam which are
abominations in the eyes of humanity.

00:58:24.040 --> 00:58:26.710
The Lilin resort to using
even such things in order to survive.

00:58:26.790 --> 00:58:28.540
This is most perplexing.

00:58:31.550 --> 00:58:34.090
Kaworu! Stop it! Why are you doing this?!

00:58:34.800 --> 00:58:37.430
The Evas and I are made of the same flesh.

00:58:37.550 --> 00:58:39.680
We are both born of Adam, you see.

00:58:40.140 --> 00:58:42.010
If it weren't for its soul,
I could merge with it.

00:58:42.720 --> 00:58:46.640
Especially since Unit 02 here
is closing off its own soul right now.

00:58:48.900 --> 00:58:49.730
An A.T. Field!

00:58:49.810 --> 00:58:52.940
Oh, right. That's what you Lilin call it.

00:58:53.530 --> 00:58:56.070
That sacred region which none may violate.

00:58:56.650 --> 00:58:59.320
The light of the heart.
Deep down, you Lilin must know.

00:58:59.990 --> 00:59:03.580
The A.T. Field is the inner wall
that we all possess.

00:59:03.660 --> 00:59:05.660
How would I know anything
about that, Kaworu?!

00:59:09.080 --> 00:59:13.000
-<i>Both Evas have reached lowest level.</i>
-<i>Target will reach Terminal Dogma in 20.</i>

00:59:14.340 --> 00:59:17.800
If we lose Unit 01's signal
and detect another change...

00:59:17.880 --> 00:59:21.140
I know, ma'am.
I'll trigger the self-destruct.

00:59:21.220 --> 00:59:23.890
It's better than letting
the Third Impact happen.

00:59:24.510 --> 00:59:25.640
I'm sorry.

00:59:25.720 --> 00:59:28.190
I don't mind dying. Not if it's with you.

00:59:28.730 --> 00:59:29.810
Thank you.

00:59:34.230 --> 00:59:35.480
<i>Humanity's fate...</i>

00:59:36.230 --> 00:59:38.860
<i>Man's hope is lined with sorrow.</i>

00:59:42.410 --> 00:59:43.240
What was that?!

00:59:43.330 --> 00:59:45.790
The most powerful A.T. Field
we've ever recorded!

00:59:45.870 --> 00:59:48.790
Light, EM waves, and subatomic particles
are all being blocked!

00:59:48.870 --> 00:59:50.080
Unable to monitor!

00:59:50.170 --> 00:59:51.710
It's a damn containment field.

00:59:51.790 --> 00:59:54.710
The target <i>and</i> Eva-01
and Eva-02 are off our scopes!

00:59:54.800 --> 00:59:56.670
Unable to contact pilot!

01:00:08.730 --> 01:00:09.560
Kaworu!

01:00:13.480 --> 01:00:14.480
Come back!

01:00:26.910 --> 01:00:28.790
Final safety device disengaged!

01:00:28.870 --> 01:00:31.040
Heaven's Door is opening!

01:00:32.420 --> 01:00:34.500
So an Angel finally made it.

01:00:35.630 --> 01:00:36.630
Hyuga.

01:00:42.680 --> 01:00:44.470
-What's that?!
-Status?

01:00:44.550 --> 01:00:45.600
It's an A.T. Field!

01:00:45.680 --> 01:00:49.810
A field of equal power is being generated
near the earlier Terminal Dogma field!

01:00:50.310 --> 01:00:52.440
It's breaking through
the containment field!

01:00:52.520 --> 01:00:54.310
What? A new Angel?

01:00:54.400 --> 01:00:56.020
Unknown! Unable to verify!

01:00:56.900 --> 01:00:58.360
Wait, it's gone!

01:00:58.940 --> 01:01:00.820
It's gone? The Angel vanished?!

01:01:02.780 --> 01:01:05.370
Adam, mother figure to my kind.

01:01:06.030 --> 01:01:09.660
Must those born of Adam return to him?

01:01:09.740 --> 01:01:11.410
Even if that means dooming humanity?

01:01:13.170 --> 01:01:14.880
Wait, this isn't...

01:01:14.960 --> 01:01:16.250
It's <i>Lilith!</i>

01:01:16.330 --> 01:01:18.880
<i>I see... So that's your plan, Lilin!</i>

01:01:32.680 --> 01:01:34.350
Thank you, Shinji.

01:01:34.440 --> 01:01:37.360
I had hoped that you would stop
Unit 02 for me.

01:01:37.440 --> 01:01:41.070
Otherwise, I may have been able
to live on alongside her.

01:01:41.150 --> 01:01:43.030
Kaworu, why are you--

01:01:43.110 --> 01:01:46.570
It's my fate. It dictates that I live on.

01:01:46.950 --> 01:01:48.780
Even if mankind perishes as a result.

01:01:49.530 --> 01:01:54.580
But I can die here if I want.
Life and death hold equal value to me.

01:01:54.750 --> 01:01:58.290
Choosing to die
is the one absolute freedom.

01:01:58.380 --> 01:02:04.170
What's that mean? Kaworu,
I don't understand what you're saying!

01:02:04.840 --> 01:02:06.220
They're my last words.

01:02:07.180 --> 01:02:09.100
Now, go ahead and destroy me.

01:02:09.970 --> 01:02:12.560
If you don't,
you and your kind will disappear.

01:02:13.060 --> 01:02:17.810
Only one lifeform can avoid extinction
and be granted a future.

01:02:18.310 --> 01:02:21.440
And you aren't someone who ought to die.

01:02:27.200 --> 01:02:29.780
Your kind needs a future.

01:02:31.490 --> 01:02:32.540
Thank you.

01:02:32.620 --> 01:02:35.330
I'm happy that I met you.

01:08:59.340 --> 01:09:01.220
TO BE CONTINUED
